# Local-only scan/texturing dev artifacts (NOT for the repo)
/_kadastr_scans/   # ~GBs of captured scan data + per-tune render outputs
/_check/           # headless render/check scratch (atlas.png, usdz, renders)
/Tools/            # ScanCheck headless harness (local dev tooling)

